homelab-domain-admin (0.1.28) unstable; urgency=medium

  * DKIM materializer: write KeyTable/SigningTable in place (their parent
    /etc/opendkim is not group-writable, so temp-file+rename could not
    create its temp there); keys keep atomic writes (their dir is 2770).
    Fixes "cannot write KeyTable.tmp: Permission denied" on signer hosts.

