homelab-domain-admin (0.1.22) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add authenticated_system_agent helper + POST /internal/v1/domains/
    recipient-access/on-behalf (system_agent-only): the one route that
    can create a recipient_access row attributed to a user OTHER than
    the caller, for homelab-block-link's own anonymous-click accept
    flow. No existing route could do this (see RecipientAccess.pm's own
    comment on `list`'s ?user= param).

